# Lydiard runs on Cloudflare (Workers + D1 + Cron + Pages). There is no long-running
# .env server anymore — configuration lives in wrangler.toml [vars], Worker secrets,
# and (for local dev) a gitignored .dev.vars file. This file documents them all.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1) Worker config — set in wrangler.toml [vars] (non-secret) before deploying:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   STRAVA_CLIENT_ID       Your Strava app client id
#   STRAVA_REDIRECT_URI    https://<worker-subdomain>.workers.dev/auth/strava/callback
#   APP_ORIGIN             Your Pages origin, e.g. https://lydiard.pages.dev (used for CORS)
#   STRAVA_FETCH_YEARS     How far back to backfill (default 3)
#   STREAMS_PER_RUN        Stream fetches per cron cycle (default 40)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2) Worker secrets — set with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET   Your Strava app client secret
#   AGENT_API_KEY          Long random token ChatGPT sends as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`
#   SITE_PASSWORD          Password required by the web app before reading `/api/*`

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3) Local development — create a gitignored `.dev.vars` file with:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   AGENT_API_KEY=local-test-key
#   STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=local-secret
#   STRAVA_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8787/auth/strava/callback
#   APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
# Then run the Worker (`npm run worker:dev`) and the frontend (`npm run dev`).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4) Frontend build (Cloudflare Pages) — set as a Pages build env var:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   VITE_API_BASE          Absolute Worker origin, e.g. https://lydiard.<sub>.workers.dev
#                          Leave empty for local dev (Vite proxies /api to :8787).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5) Garmin health-data automation / GitHub Actions:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   GARMIN_USERNAME        Garmin Connect email, used by `garmin auth` if cached tokens are missing
#   GARMIN_PASSWORD        Garmin Connect password, used by `garmin auth` if cached tokens are missing
#   LYDIARD_INGEST_KEY     Matches Worker secret INGEST_API_KEY
#   LYDIARD_BASE_URL       Worker origin, e.g. https://lydiard.lydiard.workers.dev
#   GARMIN_INCREMENTAL_DAYS Optional GitHub repo variable (default: 45)
#   GARMIN_EXTRACT_START   Optional GitHub repo variable, YYYY-MM-DD (overrides incremental start)
#   GARMIN_EXTRACT_END     Optional GitHub repo variable, YYYY-MM-DD exclusive (default: tomorrow)
#   GARMIN_DATA_TYPES      Optional GitHub repo variable (default: ACTIVITIES_LIST,ACTIVITY)
#   GARMIN_DB_PATH         Optional path to garmin-health-data SQLite DB (default ./garmin_data.db)
#   GARMIN_IMPORT_ACTIVITY_TYPES  Comma-separated activity filters (default running)
